# Keep shell scripts, Makefile recipes, and container files LF-only.
#
# A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn the
# `#!/usr/bin/env bash` shebangs into `bash\r` (EACCES on WSL/Linux) and can
# break Makefile recipes. Windows is supported through WSL2; native PowerShell,
# Git Bash, and MSYS2 are not supported.
* text=auto eol=lf
